  "title": "markAsRead and markAllAsRead silently swallow errors with no user feedback",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: ux. Severity: P2. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. Both markAsRead (lines 50-57) and markAllAsRead (lines 59-66) catch errors with empty catch blocks (`catch { // Silently handle }`). While the UI optimistically updates the isRead state, if the server rejects the request (e.g., due to auth expiry), the user sees the notification as read but it will revert on page refresh. Unlike other pages where mutations use toast.error for failure feedback, these operations give zero indication of failure.",
